    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40083" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίλοιπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>still left, remaining</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆνας ἑπτὰ τοὺς ἐπιλοίπους
				Καμβύσῃ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰ ὀκτὼ ἔτεα τῆς πληρώσιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.67
				</span></i>
			: freq. in pl., c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἐ. τῶν πολίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.33
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐ. τοῦ λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.154
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τἀπ. τῶν λόγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τἀπίλοιπ᾽ ἄκουσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					923
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				397a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ᾽πίλοιπος</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					842
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί οὖν ἦν ἐπίλοιπον</span>;
				<i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.87
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. of Time,
