					Hdt.
					2.13
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				628a
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁμέραι ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				1.33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					<u>Fr.</u>
					67
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				2.71
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				929e
			</span></i>.</div>
